{"id":"nikto","lemma":"никто","pos":"pron","rank":138,"glosses":["nobody, no one; (with negative) anybody, anyone"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0f/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Никто не хочет про это говорить.","en":"No one wants to talk about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264801","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"about, concerning"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"}]},{"text":"Никто не знает, как это сделать.","en":"Nobody knows how to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/661077","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Никто не может мне помочь.","en":"No one can help me.","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Нас бы никто не увидел.","en":"Nobody would see us.","words":[{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"would"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"увидеть"}]},{"text":"Теперь нам никто не поможет.","en":"No one can help us now.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"}]}]}